// Three crops of the school's real "Relatorio Mensal de Aulas" template
// image, used as full-bleed backgrounds with real data overlaid on top
// (see monthly-report-document.tsx) instead of redrawing the design from
// scratch. The source image (1055x1491px) was specifically redimensioned by
// the school to leave a blank ~406px band between the table header and the
// "Regras gerais" section — enough room for up to ~14 lesson rows on one
// page without needing a second page for a typical month (~10 lessons).
// Only the "Detalhamento das aulas" row data is code-drawn into that blank
// band, since the real table has a variable number of rows a fixed image
// can't fit. Inlined as base64 strings (not files under public/ or a server
// asset path) so they always ship with the JS bundle regardless of Vercel
// serverless file-tracing.

export const REPORT_TOP_BASE64 =
  "data:image/jpeg;base64,";

export const REPORT_TABLE_HEADER_BASE64 =
  "data:image/jpeg;base64,";

export const REPORT_BOTTOM_BASE64 =
  "data:image/jpeg;base64,";
